  annotation(Documentation(info="<html><h2>无状态工程派生量计算</h2><p><b>类路径：</b><code>OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations</code>　<b>类型：</b>package</p><h3>用途与定位</h3><p>无状态工程派生量计算</p><h3>阅读与调用</h3><p>本包用于组织类。按下表进入相应模型；包本身不单独启动仿真。</p><table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\"><tr><th>类</th><th>用途</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.CommandStatusCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.CommandStatusCalculation</a></td><td>布尔指令状态码计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.DataRecorderCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.DataRecorderCalculation</a></td><td>星上数据记录器业务量计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.EarthObservationCameraCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.EarthObservationCameraCalculation</a></td><td>对地观测相机任务状态计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.ExternalOrbitalHeatCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.ExternalOrbitalHeatCalculation</a></td><td>整星外表面轨道热流计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.FotonAmurCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.FotonAmurCalculation</a></td><td>科学载荷任务门控计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.GNSSFixCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.GNSSFixCalculation</a></td><td>GNSS定位状态计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.HeaterChannelCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.HeaterChannelCalculation</a></td><td>单路加热器指令与平均电导计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.InertialVectorToBody\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.InertialVectorToBody</a></td><td>惯性系至本体系无状态矢量变换</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.MagnetometerCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.MagnetometerCalculation</a></td><td>三轴轨道磁场低阶计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.MomentumUnloadingCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.MomentumUnloadingCalculation</a></td><td>磁力矩器动量卸载与消旋计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.OrbitalAccelerationCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.OrbitalAccelerationCalculation</a></td><td>轨道中心引力加速度计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.PayloadCaptureCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.PayloadCaptureCalculation</a></td><td>载荷拍摄状态与写入率计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.PointingModeEquipmentCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.PointingModeEquipmentCalculation</a></td><td>精确指向阶段设备状态与负载计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.PowerConditioningCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.PowerConditioningCalculation</a></td><td>12 V平均值调节与太阳限功率计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.PowerDistributionStatusCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.PowerDistributionStatusCalculation</a></td><td>PDB通道状态派生</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.RateGyroModeCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.RateGyroModeCalculation</a></td><td>高精度角速率陀螺工作模式计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.ReactionWheelPowerCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.ReactionWheelPowerCalculation</a></td><td>反作用飞轮平均值机电热功率计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.ReactionWheelTelemetryCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.ReactionWheelTelemetryCalculation</a></td><td>反作用飞轮角动量与饱和状态计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.SolarArrayPerformanceCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.SolarArrayPerformanceCalculation</a></td><td>体装太阳阵电热性能计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.StarQuaternionCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.StarQuaternionCalculation</a></td><td>沿用原旋转序列的星敏四元数计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.StarTrackerCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.StarTrackerCalculation</a></td><td>星敏任务门控与测量计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.SunSensorCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.SunSensorCalculation</a></td><td>太阳敏感器视线角计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.WheelSpeedServoCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.WheelSpeedServoCalculation</a></td><td>飞轮转速伺服计算</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.XBandTransmissionCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.XBandTransmissionCalculation</a></td><td>X波段发射任务门控计算</td></tr></table><h3>继承与复用</h3><p>本类的继承/别名声明如下。继承得到的端口、参数、状态和算法仍由被引用类定义，不重复增加一套行为。</p><pre>Modelica.Icons.Package annotation(IconMap(primitivesVisible=false),DiagramMap(primitivesVisible=false))</pre></html>"),
